sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Admin as Admin User
    participant Web as Next.js Admin (Client)
    participant IDP as TTU Identity (Keycloak)
    participant API as NestJS API
    participant DB as PostgreSQL (ttu_main)

    Admin->>Web: 1. Access /admin
    Web->>IDP: 2. Redirect to /openid-connect/auth (PKCE)
    Note over Web,IDP: Authorization Code Flow + S256 Code Challenge
    Admin->>IDP: 3. Authenticate with credentials
    IDP-->>Web: 4. Redirect callback with Authorization Code
    Web->>IDP: 5. Exchange Code + Code Verifier
    IDP-->>Web: 6. Return Access Token & ID Token
    Web->>API: 7. Request GET /api/v1/me (Bearer Token)
    API->>IDP: 8. Verify Token signature via JWKS (Cached)
    API->>DB: 9. Query users table where identity_subject = sub
    alt User record does not exist
        API->>DB: 10. JIT Provision User (Zero default roles)
    end
    API->>DB: 11. Load active roles & permissions
    DB-->>API: 12. Return user profile & granted permissions[]
    API-->>Web: 13. 200 OK (User profile, roles, permissions)
    Web-->>Admin: 14. Render authorized Admin Dashboard Shell
